Overview
Our global community of 20000 team members work towards one common goal: 
A world where more people and businesses have greater access to financial security.
We are made up of two kinds of business units:
Strategic business units (SBUs): SBU brings in revenue by selling products and providing ongoing service to external clients.
Service center business units( SCBUs):  SCBU provides services that benefit and support the entire organization: their focus is on internal customers.

Enterprise Strategy and Innovation
It’s a culmination of why we’re in business, whom we serve, what solutions we provide. Our path to growth and value creation begins with our three core business units:
Verticals: Asset management, Retirement and Income Solutions and Benefits and Protection.
We also have three platforms which have high growth potential, provide us a competitive advantage, and can serve the needs of our customers more effectively when combining capabilities across our verticals
Horizontals: U.S retirement, Small and Mid-sized businesses (SMBs), and high growth international markets.
